{"sha": "7772e69cd914ccff87f21eb0d155f47234a9c061282ef68fe6c4411fe47158b2", "body": ["(b) $v_2 = \\pi/\\Gamma(2) = \\pi$；$v_3 =", "\\pi^{3/2}/\\Gamma(\\frac52) = \\pi^{3/2}/(\\frac32\\cdot\\frac12", "\\sqrt\\pi) = \\frac{4\\pi}3$。椭球为 $T(B(0,1))$，其中", "$T = \\operatorname{diag}(a_1, \\dots, a_d)$：", "由\\cref{thm:b3:product:linearchange}可知体积为", "$v_d\\prod a_i$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:product:7}", "在 $\\R^2$ 中，取极坐标（见\\cref{ex:b3:product:polar}）：", "\\[", "\\int_{B(0,1)}\\frac{\\dd x\\dd y}{(x^2+y^2)^s}", "= 2\\pi\\int_0^1 r^{1 - 2s}\\,\\dd r,", "\\qquad", "\\int_{\\R^2\\setminus B(0,1)} = 2\\pi\\int_1^\\infty r^{1-2s}\\dd r:", "\\]", "有限当且仅当 $1 - 2s > -1$（$s < 1$），外部积分则要求 $1 - 2s < -1$（$s >", "1$）。在 $\\R^d$ 中避免使用球坐标，改用层饼", "表示：$\\lambda_d(\\{\\norm x^{-2s} > t\\}\\cap B(0,1)) =", "\\lambda_d(B(0, \\min(1, t^{-1/2s}))) = v_d\\min(1, t^{-d/2s})$，", "且 $\\int_0^\\infty v_d\\min(1, t^{-d/(2s)})\\dd t < \\infty$ 当且仅当", "$\\frac d{2s} > 1$，即 $s < \\frac d2$；外部积分", "收敛当且仅当 $s > \\frac d2$（在", "补集区域上作同样的计算）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:product:8}", "由托内利定理（被积函数非负）及变量替换", "$(x, y) = \\Phi(u, v) = (uv,\\ u(1-v))$，它是 $\\mathcal C^1$", "微分同胚，将 $\\intoo0\\infty\\times\\intoo01$ 映到开象限上，", "并有", "\\[", "\\det D\\Phi = \\det\\begin{pmatrix} v & u\\\\ 1 - v & -u", "\\end{pmatrix} = -uv - u(1 - v) = -u,", "\\qquad \\abs{\\det} = u :", "\\]", "\\[", "\\Gamma(p)\\Gamma(q) =", "\\iint x^{p-1}y^{q-1}\\eu^{-x-y}\\dd x\\,\\dd y", "= \\iint (uv)^{p-1}\\bigl(u(1{-}v)\\bigr)^{q-1}\\eu^{-u}\\,u\\,", "\\dd u\\,\\dd v", "= \\Gamma(p + q)\\,B(p, q).", "\\]", "将 $t = \\sin^2\\theta$ 代入 $B(p,q)$，得", "$2\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^{2p-1}\\theta\\cos^{2q-1}\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta =", "B(p, q)$。沃利斯积分：$W_n =", "\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\sin^n\\theta\\,\\dd\\theta = \\frac12B\\bigl(\\frac{n +", "1}2, \\frac12\\bigr) = \\frac{\\Gamma(\\frac{n+1}2)\\sqrt\\pi}", "{2\\,\\Gamma(\\frac n2 + 1)}$ --- 例如 $W_{2n} =", "\\frac\\pi2\\cdot\\frac{(2n)!}{4^n(n!)^2}$，利用", "$\\Gamma(n + \\frac12) = \\frac{(2n)!}{4^nn!}\\sqrt\\pi$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:product:9}", "示性函数：$\\int\\mathbf 1_B\\,\\dd(T_*\\mu) = T_*\\mu(B) =", "\\mu(T^{-1}B) = \\int\\mathbf 1_B\\circ T\\,\\dd\\mu$；由线性", "可推至简单函数 $g$，再由单调收敛定理推至 $g \\geq 0$ --- 转移", "公式。它纯属形式：它把关于", "$T_*\\mu$ 的积分重新表述，但对 $T_*\\mu$ 究竟\\emph{是什么}并未涉及。真正的", "内容在于 \\cref{thm:b3:product:linearchange} 与", "\\cref{thm:b3:product:changeofvar} 所给出的如下恒等式：", "\\[", "\\Phi_*\\bigl(\\lambda_d\\restriction_U\\bigr) =", "\\abs{\\det D\\Phi^{-1}}\\,\\lambda_d\\restriction_V", "\\quad\\text{（一个密度测度）},", "\\]", "即计算勒贝格测度的像测度 ---", "其解析输入是 $\\Phi$ 的微分几何，", "而非测度论的形式主义。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:product:10}", "由托内利定理，高斯被积函数可以分解，取 $G_1 =", "\\int_\\R\\eu^{-s^2}\\dd s = \\sqrt\\pi$ 及 $\\int_\\R", "s^2\\eu^{-s^2}\\dd s = \\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}2$（分部积分）：", "\\[", "\\int_{\\R^d}x_1^2\\,\\eu^{-\\norm x^2}\\dd x =", "\\frac{\\sqrt\\pi}2\\;\\pi^{(d-1)/2} = \\frac{\\pi^{d/2}}2,", "\\qquad", "\\int_{\\R^d}\\norm x^2\\eu^{-\\norm x^2}\\dd x =", "d\\cdot\\frac{\\pi^{d/2}}2", "\\]", "（由对称性，$\\norm x^2 = \\sum_ix_i^2$ 的 $d$ 个项贡献相等，", "即一致性检验）。对于归一化测度", "$\\pi^{-d/2}\\eu^{-\\norm x^2}\\dd x$，其二阶矩为", "$\\frac d2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:product:11}", "(a) 记 $H = \\Phi^{-1}(\\intoo0\\infty)$，其中 $\\Phi(x, y) = f(x) -", "y$ 与 $\\{y > 0\\}$ 的交集可测，因为 $(x, y)", "\\mapsto f(x)$ 与 $(x,y)\\mapsto y$ 在乘积上都可测", "（它们均为与投影的复合）。", "$x$-截面（对 $H$）为 $\\intoo0{f(x)}$，测度为 $f(x)$：", "由托内利定理对截面积分，", "\\[", "\\lambda_{d+1}(H) = \\int_{\\R^d}\\lambda_1\\bigl(\\intoo0{f(x)}", "\\bigr)\\,\\dd x = \\int_{\\R^d}f\\,\\dd\\lambda_d .", "\\]", "", "(b) 图像为 $\\{(x,y) : y \\geq f(x)\\} \\cap \\{y \\leq", "f(x)\\}$，可测；其 $x$-截面为单点集，", "测度为 $0$，由托内利定理得 $\\lambda_{d+1}(\\text{图像}) =", "\\int 0 = 0$。", "", "(c) $S^{d-1}$ 是两图像 $y =", "\\pm\\sqrt{1 - \\abs{x'}^2}$ 的并，定义在 $\\R^{d-1}$ 的单位球上，", "（沿最后一个坐标分裂）：两个零集的并，由", "(b)，仍为零集。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}